					"content": "不會吧哥們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470458
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔庫庫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470458,
					"content": "不會吧哥們！咔庫庫難道才是我們之中潛在的好運大王嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470459
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470459,
					"content": "哈哈。祝賀你啊，哥們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470460
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470460,
					"content": "咔庫庫哥們、先生，實不相瞞，我有個不情之請。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470461
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470461,
					"content": "聽說握住手就可以沾到對方的好運，我們能不能…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470462
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470462,
					"content": "哈哈！沒問題，哥們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470463,
						752470466
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔庫庫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470463,
					"content": "在歐洛倫的帶領下，大家紛紛握住了咔庫庫的翅膀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470464
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470464,
					"content": "因為手感太好，事情逐漸演變成了撫摸咔庫庫的頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470465
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470465,
					"content": "圓圓的、軟軟的，名不虛傳，令你流連忘返。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 752470466,
					"content": "天哪，真的是摸了個夠，感覺今年剩下的日子都會走運的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470467
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470467,
					"content": "一定會的。因為派蒙有非常好的夥伴，就像咔庫庫一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470468
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470468,
					"content": "看、看我幹嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470469
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470469,
					"content": "你的計畫已經圓滿達成，也該跟大家說實話了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470470
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470470,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470471
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470471,
					"content": "欸、欸？什麼意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470472,
						752470473
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470472,
					"content": "難道說咔庫庫的好運…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470474
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470474,
					"content": "好啦、好啦，也沒什麼關係吧。能有我這樣的哥們，的確是咔庫庫的好運之一啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470475
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470475,
					"content": "不要詭辯，你老實說。從一開始的釣魚起，就都是你安排的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470476
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470476,
					"content": "…嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470477
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470477,
					"content": "那位蒙德冒險家，你之前就認識？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470478
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470478,
					"content": "沒有，也只比你早認識一天吧。只是提前拜託他，請他幫忙指個路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470479
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470479,
					"content": "麻煩豚獸和阿夏拿出畫片，陪咔庫庫一路遊玩，還有那些「閃閃禮蛋」，都是我提前準備的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470480
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470480,
					"content": "哦天哪，哥們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470481
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔庫庫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470481,
					"content": "哈哈…就是人果然沒法完全讓動物理解自己的意思，結果被豚獸大王誤會了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470482
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470482,
					"content": "我猜牠可能以為我帶了其他人來搶回本來幫咔庫庫準備的東西，所以才心情不好的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470483
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470483,
					"content": "原來牠真的叫「豚獸大王」啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470484
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470484,
					"content": "當然不是，我只是順著你說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470485
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470485,
					"content": "天哪哥們，我感動了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470486
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470486,
					"content": "…哎呀總之就是這樣啦！最近正好要到咔庫庫和我們認識的紀念日了，我就想著要幫牠準備一點小禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470487
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470487,
					"content": "因為不知道咔庫庫的生日究竟是哪天，所以我們一直把這天當成咔庫庫的生日慶祝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470488
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470488,
					"content": "咔庫庫雖然一直裝作一副和大夥稱兄道弟的成熟樣子，但本身還只是一條貪玩的小龍嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470489
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470489,
					"content": "那小龍就該有小龍的樣子，給我盡情地玩，懂嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470490
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470490,
					"content": "哥們，哥們…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470491
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔庫庫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470491,
					"content": "哦？咔庫庫有話要說？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470492
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470492,
					"content": "哥們，不是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470493
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咔庫庫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470493,
					"content": "嗯嗯，我懂的，你不用說了，我們都愛你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470494
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470494,
					"content": "是啊是啊，不用不好意思。在度假村的這些天，就請你像任何一隻自由的絨翼龍一樣，好好玩耍吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470495
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊法"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470495,
					"content": "紀念日快樂，咔庫庫！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470496
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470496,
					"content": "哥們，哥們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "咔庫庫"
				},
				{
					"id": 752470473,
					"content": "都是哥們你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470474
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 752470440,
					"content": "請咔庫庫壓軸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752470441
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7524750,
